              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi oryakora ekipande ky'ezaabu eshemeziibwe, okisharureho enyuguta, ezirikushusha nk'akamanyiso kasharwirwe aha ibaare, ezihandiikirwe ngu: Oyereziibwe MUKAMA; ",
          "type": "text",
