            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ekyo kipande kigume aha buso bwa Arooni, kandi Arooni aryayekorera okutahikiirira kw'Abaisraeli oku barishiisha bareetsire empongano zaabo ezirikwera; kigume aha buso bwe obutoosha, zibone kwikirizibwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA.",
