              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekooti oryagiruka omuri bafuta, n'ekyo kikwemba nakyo okikore omuri bafuta, kandi eky'okwezirikisa ekyo okitarizemu amabara gacwereraine. ",
          "type": "text",
