          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "zijwarwe Arooni n'abatabani, baaba nibaza omu ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, nari baaba nibaza aha itambiro kuheereza omu Mwanya ogurikwera, batakaayereetaho orubanja, bakafa. Ekyo kiryaba ekiragiro ky'ebiro byona ahariwe n'aha baijukuru abarimukurata.",
          "type": "text",
